<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Order Completion Notification</title>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        color: #333;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 20px;
        border: 1px solid #ddd;
        border-radius: 5px;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      }
      h1 {
        color: #28a745;
        text-align: center;
      }
      p {
        margin: 10px 0;
      }
      .details {
        background: #f9f9f9;
        padding: 10px;
        border-left: 5px solid #28a745;
        margin: 10px 0;
      }
      .footer {
        margin-top: 20px;
        text-align: left;
        font-size: 0.9em;
        color: #666;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Order Successfully Completed</h1>
      <p>Dear <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>
      <p>
        We are happy to inform you that your order has been successfully
        completed. Please find the final details of your order below:
      </p>

      <div class="details">
        <p><strong>Item Name:</strong> {{itemName}}</p>
        <p><strong>Tracking ID:</strong> {{trackingID}}</p>
        <p>
          <strong>Specifications:</strong>
          {{itemSpecifications}}
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Reason for Order:</strong> {{orderReason}}
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Number of Items:</strong> {{numberOfItems}}
        </p>
      </div>

      <p>
        Thank you for choosing our service. If you have any further requests or
        feedback, please feel free to contact us at
        <a href="mailto:studentaffairs@lmu.edu.ng">studentaffairs@lmu.edu.ng</a>.
      </p>

      <p>We hope to serve you again soon!</p>

      <div class="footer">
        <p>Best Regards,</p>
        <p><strong>Student Affairs Office</strong></p>
        <p>Landmark University</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
